    "synthesis_rationale": "The posterior probability is derived by weighting strong positive signals (rapid 1B runs, big 2026 IP slate, and global growth) more heavily than the moderate negative signal (pre-pandemic headwinds). The anchor provides a conservative base, and the combined effect yields a high-calibrated probability with a narrow uncertainty range, acknowledging some correlation among factors that could slightly inflate or deflate the net impact."
